# Secrets must never enter Git, including historical commits.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/private/
**/secrets/
**/*.key
**/*.key.*
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*keylog*
**/*key-log*
**/sslkeys*
**/*psk*
**/*passphrase*
**/*password*
**/*.pem
!**/*.public.pem
!**/*.cert.pem
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
node_modules/
tmp/
.local-backups/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
# Capture files are NOT blanket-ignored: review real lab evidence before staging.
